#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_basic_for_prepation
msgid ""
"The sustainability statement has been prepared on a <strong>[<em>specify\n"
"                        whether on a consolidated or individual basis</em>]</strong>."
